Horde NPC Inventory State Restoshaman
    Events
        Unit - A unit Acquires an item
        Unit - A unit Loses an item
        Unit - A unit Uses an item
    Conditions
        (Triggering unit) Equal to NPC_Horde_AI_Shaman
    Actions
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                (NPC_Horde_AI_Shaman is in Companion_Group.) Not equal to True
                (Current order of NPC_Horde_AI_Shaman) Not equal to (Order(attack))
                NPC_Horde_AI_ShamanBuy Not equal to True
                NPC_Horde_AI_ShamanSell Not equal to True
                NPC_Horde_AI_ShamanCamp Not equal to True
                And - All (Conditions) are true
                    Conditions
                        (Random integer number between 1 and 50) Equal to 1
                        (Item carried by NPC_Horde_AI_Shaman in slot 1) Equal to No item
                        (Item carried by NPC_Horde_AI_Shaman in slot 2) Equal to No item
                        (Item carried by NPC_Horde_AI_Shaman in slot 3) Equal to No item
                        (Item carried by NPC_Horde_AI_Shaman in slot 4) Equal to No item
                        (Item carried by NPC_Horde_AI_Shaman in slot 5) Equal to No item
                        (Item carried by NPC_Horde_AI_Shaman in slot 6) Equal to No item
            Then - Actions
